    },
    "Each Bot can have its own screen on %@, which you can watch and take over.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个智能体都可在 %@ 上拥有独立屏幕，你可以查看并接管。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each Bot has its own memory, one chat that never resets, and routines that run on a schedule.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个智能体都有独立记忆、一段不会自动重置的连续对话，以及按计划运行的例行任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each Bot has its own plugins. Hooks only reach the plugins of the Bot a chat runs in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个智能体有独立插件；钩子只能访问当前对话所属智能体的插件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each Bot replies only when it has something new to add. Mention one with @ to ask just them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个智能体只有新内容时才会回复。通过 @提及可单独询问某个智能体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each Bot replies only when it has something new to add. Stop pauses the room.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能体只有新内容时才回复；点击停止可暂停整个会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each gateway sends its own notifications through the Hermes app plugin. They are encrypted on the gateway; only this device can read them, and they reach Apple through our relay.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个网关通过 Hermes 应用插件发送通知。通知会在网关上加密，只有本设备可以解密，并通过中继服务转交 Apple。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each notice is sealed for one device. The relay keeps only this gateway’s id, a hash of its secret, the plugin’s version and push counts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每条通知均针对单台设备加密。中继仅保存网关 ID、密钥哈希、插件版本和推送次数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each run is a chat; tap one to read it or continue it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次运行都对应一段对话，轻点即可查看或继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each task tries again at its next run.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每项任务将在下次运行时重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
