    },
    "It starts when a slot is free.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有空闲执行位时开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stays at v%@ until you allow it. The app updates it in Hermes and every Bot.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你批准前会保持 v%@；批准后应用会更新 Hermes 和每个智能体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stays installed. The app won’t turn it back on or add it to new Bots until you do.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它仍保持安装，但在你主动开启前，应用不会重新启用或为新智能体添加。"
