            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网关未报告是否支持监听“嘿，Hermes”，可能需要更新 Hermes Agent。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The gateway didn't start listening.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网关未开始监听。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The gateway didn't take the change. Check that Bot Mode is connected and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网关未接受更改，请确认智能体模式已连接后重试。"
