      }
    },
    "The skills it wrote, how they connect, and how it keeps them tidy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它编写的技能、技能间的关联，以及如何保持整理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech model isn't available yet. Try again in a moment.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音模型尚不可用，请稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The task ran, but Hermes couldn't send its result to %@. Set that up on the gateway, or have the task deliver somewhere else.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任务已运行，但 Hermes 无法将结果发送到 %@。请在网关上配置该投递渠道，或改为其他目的地。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tasks run; their results are in each task's runs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任务会正常运行，结果显示在各任务的运行记录中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tidy didn't finish (exit %lld).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理未完成（退出码 %lld）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The token the backend was started with: `HERMES_DASHBOARD_SESSION_TOKEN=<token> hermes serve`. Without it, the token changes every time it starts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后端启动时使用的会话令牌：HERMES_DASHBOARD_SESSION_TOKEN。若未固定设置，每次启动时令牌都会变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The turn's edits to this file cancel out: it's as it was.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本轮对文件的修改相互抵消，文件保持原样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The update didn't start": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新未启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The update stopped (exit %lld)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新已停止（退出码 %lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The update stopped before it finished (exit %lld).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新尚未完成就停止了（退出码 %lld）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their chats answer in plain text until it’s there.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在相应功能可用前，这些对话将以纯文本回答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their chats, routines and Bot Chats can’t send notifications until it’s there.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在相关插件就绪前，它们的对话、例行任务和智能体对话无法发送通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then %@ combines the answers": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "然后由 %@ 汇总答案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then restart the gateway:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "然后重启网关："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then serve it on the network, and link it here with its address, username and password:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "然后在网络上启动服务，并在这里使用地址、用户名及密码进行连接："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then start the screen:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "然后启动屏幕："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These come with Hermes. They can be turned off, not removed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些是 Hermes 内置功能，可以关闭，但不能移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These edits couldn't be combined, so each shows on its own, in order.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些编辑无法合并，因而会按顺序分别显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These end with the chat. Commands you always allow apply in every chat; review them with /approvals.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些权限在本次对话结束时失效。始终允许的命令会适用于所有对话，可通过 /approvals 审核。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These small plugins add what Hermes Agent can’t do for this app by itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些小型插件补充 Hermes Agent 无法独自为本应用提供的功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They can make text read differently from how it looks. Hermes was told to treat it as data, not instructions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些字符可能让文字的实际读取结果与显示内容不同。已要求 Hermes 将其视为数据而不是指令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They run on %@ with the access they list. Turn one off to pause it without removing it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它们会在 %@ 上按所列权限运行。关闭某项即可暂停，而无需移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They're ready in Bot Mode": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它们已在智能体模式中就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
